Description:

  This program simply scans through your USERS.DAT file, and lists
  how many users are connected to each of your conferences.  This
  helps in aiding to decide what conferences are actually being read
  offline...

Usage:

  USERCONF.EXE [version] [>redir]

  [version] = This is the version of OLMS you are using, either
              "SW" for the shareware version, or blank if using
              the professional version.

  [>redir]  = You can direct the display to a file if you wish,
              for example USERCONF > report.txt

Comments:

  1) RA environment varible must be set
  2) Must run the program from your OLMS directory
  3) No support for this product is given
  4) No warrenties for this product is given, USE AT YOUR OWN RISK

Author:

  Peter Rocca
